@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Search
	Frontend testing for the www search page

Scenario: View Search Results
	End users should be able to view the search on the www site.

	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click the expand search icon on the top navigation and type in the keyword "Digital Experience Platform" and click search
	Then I should be able to view the search result containing "Digital Experience Platform" in the page title
	When I click on the next link in the search results page
	Then I should be able to view the search result containing "Digital Experience Platform" in the page title
	When I click on the next link in the search results page
	Then I should be able to view the search result containing "Digital Experience Platform" in the page title
	When I click on the previous link in the search results page
	Then I should be able to view the search result containing "Digital Experience Platform" in the page title
	When I click on the previous link in the search results page
	Then I should be able to view the search result containing "Digital Experience Platform" in the page title
	When I type in the keyword "Portal" on the search page and hit return
	Then I should be able to view the search result containing "Portal" in the page title
	When I click on the next link in the search results page
	Then I should be able to view the search result containing "Portal" in the page title
	When I click on the next link in the search results page
	Then I should be able to view the search result containing "Portal" in the page title
	When I click on the previous link in the search results page
	Then I should be able to view the search result containing "Portal" in the page title
	When I click on the previous link in the search results page
	Then I should be able to view the search result containing "Portal" in the page title